{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-6-21","kind":"proposition","title":"两直线形各与他直线形相似则自相似","englishTitle":"Figures which are similar to the same rectilineal figure are also similar to one another.","book":6,"number":21,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.21","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.21/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":21,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","contentId":"euclid-6-21","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8a79040c2416db1e334f91c046407a5ac023c6a0f287f0b7adac76df21f43080","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-6-21.statement","euclid-6-21.construction.1","euclid-6-21.proof.1","euclid-6-21.proof.2","euclid-6-21.conclusion","euclid-6-21.historical.1","euclid-6-21.historical.2","euclid-6-21.historical.3","euclid-6-21.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-6-21.statement","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"204006a97013ee418ea8729111573afb00e7a0090623670c136050d54f42da91","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Figures which are similar to the same rectilineal figure are also similar to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"与同一直线数字相类似的数字也彼此类似。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线形各与他直线形相似则自相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条线都与另一条相似，它们自然是相似的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83a0ce000437873e54ed53e138561b479f34dbee56fabfa5669182a1a61cc6f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let each of the rectilineal figures A, B be similar to C; I say that A is also similar to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"直线数字A,B,每个都类似于C;我说,A也类似于B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe99121fc11a704a9dd2affcd3d412d167f983eba7fcac78b64f11d62ba924b8","citations":["euclid-6-def-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is similar to C, it is equiangular with it and has the sides about the equal angles proportional. [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A与C相似, 它与它呈正角, 其侧角与等角为成比例。 [[VI. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-6-def-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c982418d5494626e990c1d515bb790665c1fdb50f2471c2cd2e3bb7f2f2c4a7b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since B is similar to C, it is equiangular with it and has the sides about the equal angles proportional."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于B与C相似,它具有等角,其侧面与等角成比例相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":4,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a160e8798da16bed2102614013ee64c166a6221ae0cc50e811c0552f95eb5e0a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore each of the figures A, B is equiangular with C and with C has the sides about the equal angles proportional; therefore A is similar to B. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A、B图中的每一图都是C的方形,C图的两面是成比例;因此,A图与B图Q图E图D图D图A图A图A图C图C图C图73。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":5,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"21fcc9db5446aaf25fbb3405005f2e2671ebc3dcf1fcbb463fe7a9ab6b72df29","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两直线形各与他直线形相似则自相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条线都与另一条相似，它们自然是相似的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":6,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5dea85f4a57ec83cf2fd467baec45138ddd146bdeae07109b235d14b886ba085","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁戊己两直线形各与庚辛壬形相似题言两形亦自相似"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：甲乙丙丁戊己，两条线都与庚辛壬相似。命题：这两个形状也是自相似的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":7,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98ee416e7285f7a161b900f3454064056c708eec0fdeabe44fc53ec08a68bcfb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：甲乙丙形之各角既与庚辛壬形之各角等而丁戊己形之各角亦与庚辛壬形之各角等即两形之各角自相等〈公论〉两形之各角既等则甲乙丙形与庚辛壬形各等角旁各边之比例等〈五卷十一〉而丁戊己形与庚壬辛形各等角旁各边之比例亦等也是甲乙丙形与丁戊己形各等角旁各边之比例亦等也各角既等各边之比例又等即两形定相似矣〈本卷界说一〉"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：甲乙丙形状的角与庚辛壬类型的角相等，丁戊己形状的角也与庚辛壬类型的角相等，意味着两个形状的角相等。〈公论〉 由于两个形状的角相等，则甲乙丙和庚辛壬形状中等角旁边的边的比例相同 〈五卷十一〉。同样，丁戊己和庚壬辛类型的等角旁边的边的比例也相等。同样，甲乙丙和丁戊己类型的每个等角旁边的边的比例也相等。由于每个角相等，边的比例也相等，所以这两个形状必然相似。〈本卷界说一〉"}]},{"id":"euclid-6-21.source","contentId":"euclid-6-21","revisionId":"euclid-6-21@raw-8a79040c2416db1e","order":8,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b4837210697882e3ad5adb616dd8f149ac4468e20bc8806c7ef539bf77679173","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.21/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.21\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷六"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-6-21:euclid-6-def-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-6-21","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-6-21.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-def-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:6.prop.21","sourceUrl":"h